/T (The completion of all these projects requires significant resources. It would therefore be impossible for us to carry them out without the support of our valued partners. By joining our team through financial or material contributions, you will directly support the pursuit of our ambitions. In return, we commit to offering you privileged visibility during our competitions as well as at the numerous events we participate in each year.)
